===Etymology===
From {{der|en|enm|disese}}, from {{der|en|xno|desese|desese, disaise}}, from {{der|en|fro|desaise}}, from {{m|fro|des-}} + {{m|fro|aise}}. Displaced native {{cog|enm|adle|adle, audle|disease}} (from {{cog|ang|ādl||disease, sickness}}, see {{l|en|adle}}), {{cog|enm|cothe|cothe, coathe|disease}} (from {{cog|ang|coþu||disease}}, see {{l|en|coath}}). {{surf|en|dis-|ease}}.

